Description: Kiosk, screen, wifi and clock setup for Cirrus
 Configures the Chromium kiosk (one or two touchscreens), the Signal K SSL
 guard, a wifi association watchdog, and the clock safety net for a Raspberry
 Pi 5 with no RTC battery.
